questions unanswered.

241
00:13:58,070 --> 00:14:01,750
Why could a ruthless killer become
a magnetic lure for educated women?

242
00:14:02,800 --> 00:14:05,104
His brazen attitude and callous courtroom

243
00:14:05,104 --> 00:14:07,689
