before the light of justice.

248
00:14:22,310 --> 00:14:25,910
Behavioral scientists and criminal
psychologists began dissecting the

249
00:14:25,910 --> 00:14:29,510
childhood roots of Ramirez and the
inner mechanics of Hybristophilia.

250
00:14:32,310 --> 00:14:35,574
[HOST] To deconstruct the psychological
portrait of Richard Ramirez,

251
00:14:35,574 --> 00:14:39,909
criminologists must trace back to his
violent and traumatic childhood in El Paso,

252
00:14:39,909 --> 00:14:40,230
Texas.

253
00:14:41,030 --> 00:14:44,319
A serial predator is never
spontaneously born in a vacuum,

254
00:14:44,319 --> 00:14:47,268
but is always the toxic
intersection of neurological

255
00:14:47,268 --> 00:14:49,990
damage and an abusive
developmental environment.

256
00:14:50,940 --> 00:14:53,368
Born into an impoverished family in 1960,

257
00:14:53,368 --> 00:14:55,855
Ramirez experienced profound developmental

258
00:14:55,855 --> 00:14:58,460
fractures from his
earliest formative years.

259
00:14:59,260 --> 00:15:02,740
Behavioral specialists have
isolated three decisive factors

260
00:15:02,740 --> 00:15:06,220
that sculpted the nocturnal
predator of the summer of 1985.

261
00:15:07,170 --> 00:15:11,163
These factors comprise organic brain
injury, brutal domestic violence,

262
00:15:11,163 --> 00:15:14,130
and early vicarious
conditioning to extreme carnage.

263
00:15:14,930 --> 00:15:17,081
Our criminal psychologist will unpack the

264
00:15:17,081 --> 00:15:19,810
developmental mechanics of
these destructive forces.

265
00:15:21,310 --> 00:15:24,537
[PSYCHOLOGIST] The primary biological
factor originated in severe head

266
00:15:24,537 --> 00:15:27,470
trauma suffered by Ramirez
during early childhood.

267
00:15:28,270 --> 00:15:31,542
He suffered two concussive head
injuries in rapid succession:

268
00:15:31,542 --> 00:15:34,225
once when a heavy wooden
dresser collapsed on him,

269
00:15:34,225 --> 00:15:37,390
