throughout his adolescence.

273
00:15:46,540 --> 00:15:48,836
Neurological specialists note that severe

274
00:15:48,836 --> 00:15:51,300
trauma to the frontal
and temporal lobes can

275
00:15:51,300 --> 00:15:53,596
