293
00:16:50,717 --> 00:16:52,713
obliterated his moral boundaries,

294
00:16:52,713 --> 00:16:57,310
establishing violence as the primal
language for resolving internal tension.

295
00:16:58,260 --> 00:17:01,460
A profound deficit in affective
empathy completely prevented

296
00:17:01,460 --> 00:17:04,820
