absolute dominance.

300
00:17:16,160 --> 00:17:17,251
[HOST] Entering adulthood,

301
00:17:17,251 --> 00:17:21,097
Ramirez descended into methamphetamine
addiction, chronic vagrancy,

302
00:17:21,097 --> 00:17:25,920
and an escalating fantasy cycle progressing
from voyeurism to deadly home invasions.

303
00:17:26,720 --> 00:17:28,982
He evolved into a textbook mixed offender:

304
00:17:28,982 --> 00:17:32,106
exhibiting both the impulsive
disorganization of an addict

305
00:17:32,106 --> 00:17:34,960
and the opportunistic cunning
of a predatory stalker.

306
00:17:35,910 --> 00:17:38,131
He cloaked himself in satanic delusions,

307
00:17:38,131 --> 00:17:41,074
utilizing occult themes as
an internal neutralization

308
00:17:41,074 --> 00:17:44,350
