supervised institutional visitations.

359
00:20:54,890 --> 00:20:57,602
She can project any
idealized heroic traits onto

360
00:20:57,602 --> 00:21:00,032
him without ever
encountering the friction,

361
00:21:00,032 --> 00:21:03,930
