glamorizes outlaws into alluring,

364
00:21:10,672 --> 00:21:12,120
rebellious archetypes.

365
00:21:12,920 --> 00:21:17,741
Yet behind this hollow romanticization
lies an appalling disregard for the lives,

366
00:21:17,741 --> 00:21:20,360
dignity, and trauma of
the murdered victims.

367
00:21:21,310 --> 00:21:24,560
The idolization of criminality
erodes societal ethical

368
00:21:24,560 --> 00:21:28,110
foundations and offers toxic
templates to vulnerable youth.

369
00:21:28,910 --> 00:21:32,664
Dissecting this syndrome serves as
an urgent wake-up call to identify

370
00:21:32,664 --> 00:21:37,070
dysfunctional psychological patterns before
they manifest in harmful attachments.

371
00:21:38,570 --> 00:21:42,358
[HOST] These profound clinical insights
into Hybristophilia peel away the mystery

372
00:21:42,358 --> 00:21:45,890
