looks toward a serial murderer.

461
00:27:09,010 --> 00:27:11,432
It was one of the most
chilling spectacles of moral

462
00:27:11,432 --> 00:27:14,330
distortion that I encountered
in my entire journalism career.

463
00:27:15,330 --> 00:27:19,079
Those admirers saw no shattered
